From 44af2daaea86804830c56dd03813c6a20aceacfa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Helium contributors <https://github.com/imputnet/helium>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] cmux: adapt Helium's clean New Tab page

Adapted from Helium revision 8030a8a3050151a141c06cc5a85f95cbbdc42a25
(0.14.7, Chromium 150.0.7871.128 revision 7), specifically:

  patches/helium/ui/always-use-better-ntp.patch
  patches/helium/ui/clean-new-tab-page.patch
  patches/helium/ui/fix-customize-side-panel.patch
  patches/helium/ui/restyle-ntp-tiles.patch
  patches/helium/ui/square-ntp-monograms.patch

The M151 adaptation keeps Chromium's live NTP DOM and hides its promotional,
search, and module surfaces in CSS. This preserves Customize Chrome's native
background/shortcut state while presenting Helium's centered shortcut layout.

Helium is GPL-3.0-only; see third_party/helium/LICENSE and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
